                                        <item name="Description" type_name="gh_string" type_code="10">List of angles [deg] of the top reinforcement layer relative to the local x-axis. A positive rotation angle rotates counterclockwise if the local z-axis points towards the observer. The 2nd to 4th layers are assumed to have these angles relative to the 1st layer: 90[deg], 90[deg], 0[deg]. The list of angles is mapped on the list of faces according to the longest list principle.</item>
